    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "EvelynnPassive",
        "name": "恶魔魅影",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "在非战斗状态下，伊芙琳进入【恶魔魅影】。【恶魔魅影】会在伊芙琳生命值较低时治疗她，并在6级后为她提供【伪装】。",
        "bodyHtml": "在不攻击或使用技能4秒后，伊芙琳将自身笼罩在<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">恶魔魅影</span>中。当低于<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(250 + (250% 法术强度))生命值</span>时，<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">恶魔魅影</span>每秒回复<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(15 ~ 150)生命值</span>。从6级开始，它还会提供<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">伪装</span>。<br /><br />受到来自英雄或防御塔的伤害，会使<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">恶魔魅影</span>被移除1.5秒。",
        "iconFile": "Evelynn_Passive.png",
        "cooldownSeconds": [],
